A01 -> Broken Access Control
 What is it??
-> When an user can access priviledged or protected data.. when they are not suppossed to,
access data of different user.


Lets take Scenario 1

Ki url mai humne samjho.. account id badla.. like id = 5 ko change kiya to id = 6.. ki id = 6 ke account ke details mil gaye.. this is Broken access control
this is commonly called -> IDOR (Insecure Direct Object Reference)
Scenario 2 

http://example.cpm/app/getinfo  -> original url
if the user changes it to 
http://example.cpm/app/admin_getinfo -> Admin ke details access ho paa rahe.. jo ki nahi hone chaiye..

